---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article','headline':'HOA Management Software Pricing Guide','mainEntityOfPage':'https://camvella.com/guides/hoa-software-pricing-guide/','about':['HOA software pricing','community association management software cost']}
---
<BaseLayout
  title="HOA Management Software Pricing Guide | Camvella"
  description="Understand HOA software pricing models, implementation costs, transaction fees, add-ons and total cost before comparing community association management platforms."
  schema={schema}
>
<section class="guide-hero"><div class="container container--narrow"><p class="section__label">Pricing guide</p><h1>How to compare HOA software pricing without missing the expensive parts.</h1><p>Sticker price is only one part of software cost. Management companies should compare the subscription, implementation, migration, transaction fees, paid modules and outside systems still required after launch.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow guide-body">
  <h2>Common pricing structures</h2><p>HOA platforms may charge per association, per unit, per user, by portfolio tier or through a combination of these. Ask exactly what changes when your portfolio grows.</p>
  <h2>Implementation and migration</h2><p>Confirm whether setup, data migration, accounting import, training and launch support are included or quoted separately.</p>
  <h2>Transaction and payment costs</h2><p>Payment processing, lockbox, ACH, card transactions, document delivery and communication services can materially change the effective monthly cost.</p>
  <h2>Paid modules and integrations</h2><p>Ask whether accounting, violations, ARC, resident portals, board tools, e-signatures, communications, reporting and automation are included or sold as add-ons.</p>
  <h2>External software you still need</h2><p>The real cost includes every additional tool required to fill product gaps. Compare the complete stack, not only the vendor’s subscription line.</p>
  <div class="pricing-check"><h2>Questions to ask every vendor</h2><ul><li>What is included in the quoted base price?</li><li>What triggers a price increase?</li><li>Are implementation and migration separate?</li><li>Which modules cost extra?</li><li>Are there per-transaction charges?</li><li>Can we export our data without an extra fee?</li></ul></div>
  <div class="guide-cta"><h2>Compare Camvella using your real portfolio size.</h2><p>We will show the product and explain the pricing structure against the number of communities you manage.</p><a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/demo">Book a Demo</a><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/pricing">View Pricing</a></div>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.guide-hero{padding:128px 0 72px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--clr-navy),#0d3857);color:#fff}.guide-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.1rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em;max-width:18ch;margin:.5rem 0 1.3rem}.guide-hero p{font-size:var(--text-lg);line-height:1.75;color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);max-width:62ch}.guide-body h2{color:var(--clr-navy);margin:2.2rem 0 .75rem}.guide-body>p{color:var(--clr-text-soft);line-height:1.8}.pricing-check{margin:2.5rem 0;padding:2rem;border-radius:var(--radius-xl);background:#f7fbfc;border:1px solid var(--clr-border)}.pricing-check h2{margin-top:0}.pricing-check ul{display:grid;gap:.65rem;padding-left:1.2rem;color:var(--clr-text-soft)}.guide-cta{margin-top:3rem;padding:2rem;border-radius:var(--radius-xl);background:var(--clr-navy);color:#fff}.guide-cta h2{color:#fff;margin-top:0}.guide-cta p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);margin:.6rem 0 1.2rem}.guide-cta .btn{margin-right:.6rem;margin-top:.5rem}
</style>
